  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From Biot-Savart&#39;s law, magnetic field due to current carrying conductor is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Where, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Since there are four sides, the&nbsp;total magnetic field is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
